2. PRODUCT IDENTITY

Product name: CalcMaster 2026.

Product category: Scientific calculator, step-by-step learning platform, mathematics and physics game studio, interactive simulation laboratory, and AI-assisted personal tutor.

Primary platform: Android phones and tablets.

Future platforms: iOS, desktop and web where appropriate.

Primary audience: Class 11 students, approximately ages 15–17, studying mathematics, physics and trigonometry.

