3. PRODUCT VISION

Build a trustworthy learning companion where a student can calculate a difficult expression, understand why the answer is correct, experiment with the underlying concept, practise through a game and revisit mistakes later.

The calculator must remain a useful independent scientific tool even for students who never create an account, use AI or play games.

The application must feel like a premium scientific instrument combined with a modern interactive learning environment.

